<title>SPAIN: Santander says sells its 15.8 pct of Riojanas.</title>
<headline>Santander says sells its 15.8 pct of Riojanas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Santander sold its total 15.8 percent stake in Bodegas Riojanas for some 750 million pesetas, a Santander spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;Santander has sold its 15.8 percent stake,&quot; a spokesman from the bank said, adding that details of the sale in a press report were wrong.</p>
<p>Earlier, a report in financial daily Cinco Dias said the group had sold a 40 percent stake for two billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
